{"availability":"available","full":"HKUDS/Vibe-Trading","name":"Vibe-Trading","description":"\"Vibe-Trading: Your Personal Trading Agent\"","category":"Finance","language":"Python","stars":34516,"forks":5606,"created":"2026-04-01T09:52:20Z","updated":"2026-10-04T03:51:45Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://vibetrading.wiki/","topics":["ai-agent","algorithmic-trading","backtesting","fintech","llm","mcp","multi-agent","python","quantitative-finance","trading"],"demo":null,"color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:52:11.307Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T06:52:11.307Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T06:52:11.307Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T21:19:25.186Z","stars":34492,"forks":5606},{"at":"2026-10-04T06:52:11.307Z","stars":34516,"forks":5606}],"technologies":["Python"],"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:52:11.307Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T05:01:02.890Z","latestRelease":{"name":"v0.1.16 — a number that can show where it came from","tag":"v0.1.16","publishedAt":"2026-09-29T08:37:30Z","url":"https://github.com/HKUDS/Vibe-Trading/releases/tag/v0.1.16"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T05:01:02.890Z","screenshots":[],"overviewAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T06:01:24.447Z","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["English | 中文 | 日本語 | 한국어 | العربية | Español | Bahasa Indonesia","Vibe-Trading is an open-source research workspace for turning finance questions into runnable analysis. It connects natural-language prompts to market-data loaders, strategy generation, backtest engines, reports, exports, and persistent research memory.","It is designed for research, simulation, and backtesting — and, when you choose, autonomous trading through a broker you authorize yourself (e.g. Robinhood Agentic Trading). It holds no funds and never trades outside the limits you set, and you can halt it instantly."],"features":["• Natural-language market research","• Strategy drafts and file/web analysis","• Memory-backed workflows","• Investment, quant, crypto, and risk teams","• Streaming progress and persisted reports"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HKUDS/Vibe-Trading/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"416e4c950b36fc163b2685bb800188b6435afe2ba5790727d6ed18fd05d61d2a","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T06:52:11.317Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:52:11.317Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-04T03:51:45Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"English | 中文 | 日本語 | 한국어 | العربية | Español | Bahasa Indonesia","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HKUDS/Vibe-Trading/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"It is designed for research, simulation, and backtesting — and, when you choose, autonomous trading through a broker you authorize yourself (e.g. Robinhood Agentic Trading). It holds no funds and never trades outside the limits you set, and you can halt it instantly.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HKUDS/Vibe-Trading/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Email and WebSocket join the guided channel setup, with mail-server certificates now verified and settings writes closed to cross-site pages, and a plain IMAP login is upgraded with STARTTLS before the password goes out (#1544).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HKUDS/Vibe-Trading/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"2026-09-17 🔐 A Robinhood login that reaches several accounts, and a live gate that refused every real order while its tests passed: Robinhood can now be a read-only portfolio source that reads exactly one account, picked from Robinhood's own list with nothing preselected (#1428), and live trading binds each mandate to one account the same way (#1442).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HKUDS/Vibe-Trading/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"2026-06-16 🛡️ Security/API hardening + GLM/Zhipu alias: Settings writes require auth when configured (#245); API shell-capable tools require explicit VIBETRADINGENABLESHELLTOOLS=1 opt-in (#243); local shutdown requires auth when an API key is configured (#241); and untrusted loopback-looking hosts are rejected instead of treated as local (#242).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HKUDS/Vibe-Trading/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"2026-06-09 🔑 Clearer error when the Web UI is opened from another machine: Reaching the chat from a non-loopback client (another machine, a VM host, a phone on your LAN) without APIAUTHKEY set returned 403 on every sensitive endpoint — sending a message, listing sessions, live status — but the chat only showed a generic \"Failed to send message, please retry.\" The send path…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HKUDS/Vibe-Trading/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"416e4c950b36fc163b2685bb800188b6435afe2ba5790727d6ed18fd05d61d2a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HKUDS/Vibe-Trading/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T06:52:11.323Z"},"readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/HKUDS/Vibe-Trading/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-04T06:52:11.342Z","hash":"416e4c950b36fc163b2685bb800188b6435afe2ba5790727d6ed18fd05d61d2a","originalBytes":357253,"storedBytes":357253,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["now","thanks","vibe-trading","run","broker","read-only","mcp","api","sdk","agent","data","live","trading","one","instead","tool","closes","backtest","every","swarm","research","only","new","declared","local","paper","provider","source","tools","read","alpha","order","through","cli","connector","never","web","account","get","key","own","each","longer","same","path","while","none","runs","account.read","positions.read","market","install","loader","session","when","across","mandate","model","orders.read","portfolio","history.read","quotes.read","settings","call","plus","strategy","before","crypto","list","bars","bash","channels","docker","search","channel","real","runtime","still","symbol","skills","zoo","default","fallback","risk","without","a-share","gate","